{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":59940,\"title\":\"Zebra Lounge\",\"tagline\":\"Their first meeting was daring. Their last would be deadly.\",\"overview\":\"Alan and Wendy Barnet have been married just long enough for the excitement to have gone out of their relationship, and they're looking for a way to put some spice back in their lives. After placing a personal ad looking for another couple interested in swapping mates, the Barnets are led to the Zebra Lounge, where they meet Jack and Louise Bauer, a pair of seasoned erotic adventurers. While the Barnets find the swinging scene exciting at first, they soon decide it may be doing more harm than good to their marriage. But easing the Bauers out of their lives proves to be neither simple nor safe.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hyej1bAJkY39O1tVIYdjLM6nfl6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oJqXClbe4ttTGohmbgO8n8UVVeV.jpg\",\"rating\":4.5,\"voteCount\":47,\"year\":2001,\"runtime\":93,\"genres\":[\"Thriller\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"CA\",\"name\":\"Canada\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Kari Skogland\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":22140,\"name\":\"Kari Skogland\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5MSVfb2hKtDo3S386YSHjcdaYDC.jpg\"},{\"id\":56128,\"name\":\"Kristy Swanson\",\"character\":\"Louise Bauer\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8gPVElKDCBllmfIP0pjZL9zISKv.jpg\"},{\"id\":9045,\"name\":\"Stephen Baldwin\",\"character\":\"Jack Bauer\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w2nZjBsEsjboQDZJXEkysuGgue4.jpg\"},{\"id\":119759,\"name\":\"Brandy Ledford\",\"character\":\"Wendy Barnet\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fQyIIX977L084N1b2ycuU4lC9i0.jpg\"},{\"id\":80407,\"name\":\"Cameron Daddo\",\"character\":\"Alan Barnet\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6oJz4Yu515JUjpfQ9SxdJ0a5Lpy.jpg\"},{\"id\":1239541,\"name\":\"Dara Perlmutter\",\"chara